; bean-query prints open and price lines in its printer's fixed columns:
; an open pads its account to 47 characters before the comma-joined
; currencies and booking method (a longer account overflows), and a price
; pads its commodity to 22 and right-aligns its amount in 22, keeping each
; number's own precision.
option "operating_currency" "USD"
2019-01-01 open Assets:Bank USD
2019-01-01 open Assets:Multi USD,CAD,EUR
2019-01-01 open Assets:Stock "FIFO"
2019-01-01 open Assets:Brokerage HOOL,USD "LIFO"
2019-01-01 open Assets:A:Very:Long:Account:Name:That:Exceeds:Forty:Seven USD
2019-01-01 open Assets:Meta USD
  note: "hello"
2019-01-01 open Assets:Plain
2019-01-01 open Equity:Opening
2019-02-01 * "x"
  Assets:Bank   1000.00 USD
  Assets:Multi  1.2345 USD
  Equity:Opening
2019-12-31 price HOOL 13.00 USD
2019-12-31 price HOOL 13 USD
2019-12-31 price VERYLONGCOMMODITYNAMEXYZ 1.5 EUR
2019-12-31 price HOOL 123456789012345678901234.00 USD
2019-12-31 price CAD 0.75 USD
  source: "boc"
2019-12-31 price EUR 1.1 CAD
